# LES workspace

Primary UTC hours: **2025-09-01 10:00** and **2025-09-08 00:00** (manuscript alignment).

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `experiments/` | OpenFOAM LES case bank (many variants per hour) |
| `scripts/` | `run_case.slurm`, `make_isolated_case.sh`, `spin_seg.slurm`, `slurm_logs/` |
| `util/` | Probe/plot helpers for individual cases |
| `analysis/2000s/` | 2000 s LiDAR–LES analysis pipeline (`run_p0.py` … `run_p3.py`) |
| `docs/` | Methods, verification, agent briefings |
| `results/les/2000s/` (repo root) | Figures from `analysis/2000s` |

Case-local figures (`figs*`, `figs_long`) stay under each experiment directory.

## Generic LES job

```bash
export CASE_DIR=$PWD/LES/experiments/20250901_1000_long_DFI
sbatch --export=ALL,CASE_DIR,END_TIME=2000 LES/scripts/run_case.slurm
```

## 2000 s analysis

```bash
cd LES/analysis/2000s
python run_p0.py
python tests/test_p0.py
python run_p1.py
```

Figures regenerate to `results/les/2000s/`.
